and eight healthy control subjects (7 female, mean age 24.4,
range 23–28 years) participated. All participants provided
full written informed consent. The diagnosis of neuropathic
POTS was made according to published criteria (Grubb,
2008; Freeman et al., 2011) and was based upon the patients’
